# Fixture bytes must be identical on every machine (Gate2-A compares raw bytes).
# -text disables all EOL conversion: git never rewrites these files on checkout,
# regardless of core.autocrlf. Without this, Windows checkout (CRLF) and Linux CI
# (LF) would test different inputs and Gate2-A could go red spuriously.
assets/samples/** -text
# Generated placeholder icons (Spike only, see docs/SPIKE-REPORT.md): binary, no conversion.
apps/editor/src-tauri/icons/* binary
